/F1 15 Tf
1 0 0 1 58 770 Tm (A new way to approach personal development) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 58 736 Tm (The foreword describes the possibility of a new consciousness and a new understanding of) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 721 Tm (the resources within the self. In practical terms, this means becoming more aware of your) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 706 Tm (inner life. You begin observing: The thoughts you repeat. The emotions you strengthen.) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 691 Tm (The images you hold in your mind. The purpose you return to. The actions you take each) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 676 Tm (day. The conditions that support or weaken your progress. This approach makes personal) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 661 Tm (development active. You are no longer simply waiting to feel motivated. You are creating) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 646 Tm (a structure that helps you practise the qualities you want to develop.) Tj
/F1 15 Tf
1 0 0 1 58 623 Tm (Your daily practice begins with one thought) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 58 589 Tm (You do not need to transform your entire life in one day. Begin with one thought. Choose) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 574 Tm (one constructive quality you want to develop, such as: Calmness. Courage. Concentration.) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 559 Tm (Patience. Confidence. Discipline. Clarity. Purpose. Sit quietly for a few minutes and) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 544 Tm (bring your attention back to that quality whenever your mind wanders. Then ask yourself:) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 529 Tm (How can I express this quality in one practical action today? This is how thought begins) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 514 Tm (to become application.) Tj
/F1 15 Tf
1 0 0 1 58 491 Tm (The real advantage is understanding yourself) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 58 457 Tm (The greatest advantage of studying The Master Key System is not simply the promise of) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 442 Tm (achieving a particular result. It is the opportunity to understand how your thinking) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 427 Tm (influences your experience. You begin to notice when fear is directing you. You recognise) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 412 Tm (when your attention is scattered. You see how repeated thoughts can become habits. You) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 397 Tm (discover that concentration is not an abstract idea but a skill that can be practised.) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 382 Tm (You begin to understand that personal development requires your participation. The power) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 367 Tm (is not found in reading one more book. It is found in learning how to apply what you) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 352 Tm (read.) Tj
/F1 15 Tf
1 0 0 1 58 329 Tm (Begin studying the Master Key System) Tj
